<title>NEW ZEALAND: Brierley ups stake in Tasman Ag.</title>
<headline>Brierley ups stake in Tasman Ag.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brierley Investments Ltd said on Tuesday it had acquired a further 13.7 million shares in Tasman Agriculture Limited, lifting its stake to 72.57 million shares, or 53.76 percent.</p>
<p>Under a rights issue earlier this year, 12 million shares were acquired at the issue price of NZ$1.20.</p>
<p>The remaining shares totalling 1,750,000 were bought in the past year for between $1.36 and $1.20.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
</text>
